held, then idle: requests the server saw: 1; answered within 0.9 to 3 s: yes
  request 0: failed, retry-safe no, unsent no
    closed: timed out: the connection closed: QUIC's idle timeout passed
  request 1: failed, retry-safe yes, unsent yes
    closed: refused: the connection closed: the request never reached QUIC, so it may be sent again
  the server's request failed: yes
  closed once each: yes; clean: client no, server no
answered, then idle: done, right: yes; closed clean: client yes, server yes
